      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-22T10:45:09.511Z",
      "description": "A vulnerability was found in TRENDnet TEW-821DAP 2.2.01b05. Affected is an unknown function of the file /cgi-bin/upload.cgi of the component ssi. Performing a manipulation of the argument filename results in command injection. The attack may be initiated remotely. The exploit has been made public and could be used.",
      "severity": 7.4,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：TRENDnet TEW-821DAP\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
